# Theming

## One source of truth

- Every colour, size, radius, elevation and duration comes from `lib/theme/app_tokens.dart`.
- `lib/theme/app_theme.dart` builds the light, dark and paper `ThemeData` from one function, `_buildTheme(AppPalette, TajweedTheme)`. Do not add a second builder or per-appearance overrides.
- Widgets read colour from `Theme.of(context).colorScheme` or `AppPalette.of(context)`. Do not write `Color(0x…)` or `Colors.*` in page or widget files; add a palette role instead.
- `test/app_palette_test.dart` holds every text role to WCAG AA (4.5:1) on every surface step and borders to 3:1. A palette change that breaks contrast fails there.
- `test/app_theme_test.dart` is the contract for the component themes below.

## Palette (`AppPalette`)

Three constant palettes: `AppPalette.light`, `.dark`, `.paper`. Roles:

| Role | Use | Light | Dark |
|------|-----|-------|------|
| `canvas` | Scaffold, app bar, nav bar | `#FAF8F4` | `#0B1113` |
| `surface` | Cards, sheets, fields | `#FFFFFF` | `#131B1E` |
| `surfaceLow` … `surfaceHighest` | Tonal steps for nested surfaces | `#F6F3EE` … `#E9E6DF` | `#10171A` … `#212D32` |
| `ink` / `inkMuted` | Body text / secondary text | `#1B2326` / `#55626A` | `#E6ECEA` / `#A3B0B3` |
| `outline` / `hairline` | Control borders / card borders, dividers | `#7C878C` / `#DEDAD2` | `#6A7B80` / `#2B383C` |
| `primary` (+ `primaryTint`) | Brand teal, selected states | `#0B4D5C` | `#7CC7D6` |
| `accent` (+ `accentTint`) | The one gold accent | `#8A5A12` | `#E0B56A` |
| `meccan` / `medinan` | Revelation-place labels | `#8A5A12` / `#1F6B47` | `#E0B56A` / `#7FD1A3` |
| `error` (+ `errorTint`) | Errors | `#B3261E` | `#F2B8B5` |

The `ColorScheme` is a direct mapping of these roles (`primaryContainer` = `primaryTint`, `tertiary` = `accent`, `onSurfaceVariant` = `inkMuted`, `outlineVariant` = `hairline`). `surfaceTint` is transparent: elevation never tints a surface.

## Type (`AppType`)

`display` 28/34, `title` 22/28, `headline` 18/24, `subtitle` 16/24, `body` 16/24, `bodyCompact` 14/21, `label` 14/20, `caption` 12/16. Nothing is smaller than 12. Every style carries the Arabic font fallback. Use `Theme.of(context).textTheme` slots; do not set a raw `fontSize` in UI chrome.

Arabic source text is separate: `lib/ui/widgets/arabic_text.dart` sets its own font, line height and strut and must not change.

## Surfaces and components

- Cards: flat, `surface` fill, 1 px `hairline` border, `AppRadius.card`, zero margin. Same in every appearance.
- App bar, navigation bar and rail: flat, on `canvas`, no scrolled-under shadow.
- Buttons: flat, at least 48 dp tall (`AppSpacing.minTouchTarget`).
- Text fields and the search bar: `surface` fill, `outline` border, `primary` 1.5 px when focused, `AppRadius.input`.
- Chips: `AppRadius.chip`, `outline` border, `primaryTint` when selected.
- Sheets: `surface`, `AppRadius.sheetTop`, one handle (`SheetHandle`, `AppSheetHandle.size`).
- Snackbars: floating, on `inverseSurface`.
- Only overlays (snackbars, dialogs, menus) use `AppElevation.overlay`.

## Motion (`AppMotion`)

Durations `fast` 120 ms, `base` 200 ms, `slow` 320 ms; curve `easeOutCubic`. Entrance animations go through `FadeSlideIn` (`lib/ui/widgets/fade_slide_in.dart`), which shows its child immediately when the system "remove animations" setting is on. Do not animate with ad-hoc durations.

## Tajweed Colours

Tajweed colours are **standalone constants** in `lib/ui/widgets/tajweed.dart`, matching quran.com's Madani mushaf scheme. They are NOT theme-dependent (same on light and dark).

| Rule | Constant | Colour | Hex |
|------|----------|--------|-----|
| Silent letter | `kNotPronouncedColor()` | Grey | #9E9E9E (dark) / #BDBDBD (light) |
| Normal Madd (2 counts) | `kNormalMaadColor` | Pink | #E91E8C |
| Separated Madd (2/4/6) | `kMaadSukoonColor` | Orange | #FB8C00 |
| Connected Madd (4/5, before hamza) | `kMaadConnectedColor` | Dark Pink | #D81B60 |
| Necessary Madd (6 counts) | `kMaadLongColor` | Red | #F44336 |
| Ghunnah / Ikhfa / Idgham-gh / Iqlab / Meem | `kGhunnahColor` | Green | #43A047 |
| Qalqala (echo) | `kQalqalaColor` | Cyan | #00BCD4 |
| Tafkhim (heavy) | `kTafkhimColor` | Dark Blue | #1565C0 |

`kNotPronouncedColor(Brightness)` is the only brightness-aware colour — returns a different grey for readability on dark vs light backgrounds.

> **Legacy:** `TajweedTheme` (`lib/theme/tajweed_extension.dart`) is still registered in every `ThemeData` but is **not used** by the tajweed engine. The engine reads colours from the constants above.
